  "content": {
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "order": 1,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s1",
            "text": "What's the most dangerous job?"
          },
          {
            "id": "s2",
            "text": "Some people think it's logging."
          },
          {
            "id": "s3",
            "text": "Over 100 loggers out of every 100,000 die in a work accident."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "order": 2,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s4",
            "text": "There are many reasons for this."
          },
          {
            "id": "s5",
            "text": "Loggers use dangerous tools, like chainsaws."
          },
          {
            "id": "s6",
            "text": "They work with big machines."
          },
          {
            "id": "s7",
            "text": "They cut down heavy trees."
          },
          {
            "id": "s8",
            "text": "They also work in hard-to-reach places."
          },
          {
            "id": "s9",
            "text": "So, it's difficult for an ambulance to reach a hurt logger."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "order": 3,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s10",
            "text": "Loggers do have rules to stay safe."
          },
          {
            "id": "s11",
            "text": "But many still die every year."
          },
          {
            "id": "s12",
            "text": "Some people believe we should only use machines for this work."
          },
          {
            "id": "s13",
            "text": "But then all the loggers will lose their jobs."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
